Hello World!

## Hello, Firecrawl!

A tiny "Hello World" for [Firecrawl](https://firecrawl.dev): scrape a web page
and print it back as clean Markdown.

### Quick start

    pip install -r requirements.txt
    export FIRECRAWL_API_KEY="fc-..."      # get a key at https://firecrawl.dev
    python3 hello_firecrawl.py              # scrapes https://example.com
    python3 hello_firecrawl.py https://firecrawl.dev

Copy `.env.example` to `.env` and fill in your key, or export
`FIRECRAWL_API_KEY` directly.

Docs: https://docs.firecrawl.dev
